GET {{baseUrl}}/projects?sort_by=name&sort_order=asc
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### 20. 过滤测试
GET {{baseUrl}}/projects/{{projectId}}/tasks?status=todo&priority=high
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### 21. 删除任务
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/tasks/{{taskId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 22. 删除项目
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/projects/{{projectId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 23. 注销/令牌撤销
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

### 24. Google OAuth 认证流程 - 初始化
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/google

### 25. 文档和静态资源测试
GET http://localhost:8080/docs/
Accept: text/html

### 26. Swagger UI 访问测试
GET http://localhost:8080/swagger/index.html
Accept: text/html

### 27. API Schema 获取
GET http://localhost:8080/swagger/doc.json
Accept: application/json

### 28. 系统指标测试
GET http://localhost:8080/metrics
Accept: text/plain

### 29. CORS 预检请求测试
OPTIONS {{baseUrl}}/projects
Origin: http://localhost:3000
Access-Control-Request-Method: POST
Access-Control-Request-Headers: Content-Type, Authorization

### 30. 批量操作测试 (如果支持)
POST {{baseUrl}}/tasks/batch
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "operations": [
    {
      "op": "update",
      "id": 1,
      "data": {
        "status": "completed"
      }
    }
  ]
}
